module test.modules.BareOpen where

import test.modules.Bit

-- **Refused, and `Inherits.thena` is its twin rather than its control.** `Bit`
-- is imported, so `Bit.off` is in scope and `off` is not. Before MS11 phase 283
-- it loaded or failed according to whether a file whose top level wrote
-- `open Bit` had gone in first; since the ruling of 2026-11-06 a file that
-- imports such a module is refused in just this way too — see
-- `Thena.LoadTests`.
b : Bit.Bit
b = off
